// English strings for SplashMenuBar.
// Key = the key Foundation derives from the Swift source literal;
// value = the English text. Translate a language by copying this file
// into <lang>.lproj/Localizable.strings and replacing the values.

"DECODE SPEED · TOK/S" = "解碼速度 · TOK/S";
"Decode speed (tok/s): the last %lld samples taken while a request is generating, every %@ (span and UI refresh in Settings). Samples are evenly spaced by count, not by wall-clock time — idle gaps don't stretch them. The dotted line is the average of the samples shown. Right-click to pick the line's color." = "解碼速度（tok/s）：請求生成期間按每 %2$@ 採樣（採樣跨度與 UI 刷新在「設定」中配置），記錄的是最近 %1$lld 個樣本。樣本按數量均勻分佈，而不是按時間 — 空閒間隔不會把它們拉長。虛線是所顯示樣本的平均值。右鍵可選擇線條顏色。";
"LAST REQUEST" = "最近請求";
"Figures for the most recently finished request, from splash's Done log line." = "最近一次已完成請求的資料，來自 splash 的 Done 日誌行。";
"LOAD" = "負載";
"Server-wide totals and averages since splash started." = "splash 啟動以來伺服器範圍的總計與平均值。";
"SERVER" = "伺服器";
"What splash is serving and where." = "splash 正在提供什麼服務、位於哪裡。";
"external" = "外部";
"This server wasn't started by Splash Menu Bar (e.g. run from a terminal). Stop still shuts it down; quitting the app leaves it running." = "該伺服器不是由 Splash Menu Bar 啟動的（例如從終端運行）。按「停止」仍會將其關閉；退出應用則它繼續運行。";
"Unpin" = "取消固定";
"Pin" = "固定";
"Pinned: this panel stays open until you unpin it, and you can drag it anywhere by its top edge. Click to unpin and snap it back under the menu bar." = "已固定：此面板保持打開，直到你取消固定；可按住其頂邊將其拖到任意位置。點擊可取消固定，並將其貼回菜單欄下方。";
"Pin this panel open, so clicking elsewhere, pressing Esc or using its buttons doesn't close it. Pinned, you can drag it anywhere on screen by its top edge." = "固定此面板使其保持打開：點擊其他位置、按 Esc 或使用其按鈕都不會關閉它。固定後，可按住其頂邊把它拖到屏幕任意位置。";
"Settings (⌘,): edit the splash serve options. Saving restarts the server." = "設定（⌘,）：編輯 splash serve 選項。儲存後伺服器會重啟。";
"Starting splash…" = "正在啟動 splash…";
"What splash is doing before it can serve: the current stage, download progress (size · speed · time left), time since launch, and its latest output line." = "splash 在可提供服務之前正在做什麼：當前階段、下載進度（大小 · 速度 · 剩餘時間）、啟動以來的時間，以及它最新的輸出行。";
"splash exited" = "splash 已退出";
"splash exited: %@. The lines below are its last output; select the text to copy it. Press Start to run it again." = "splash 已退出：%@。下方是它最後的輸出；選中文字即可複製。按「啟動」可再次運行它。";
"A splash server started outside the app is serving port %lld, so the app uses that one. Restart runs splash from the app instead." = "應用外啟動的 splash 伺服器正在提供端口 %lld 的服務，因此應用使用了它。按「重啟」會改為由應用來運行 splash。";
"The splash this app started exited, but an externally started splash is serving port %lld — the app is using that server. Restart shuts it down and runs splash from the app with the current settings." = "本應用啟動的 splash 已退出，但外部啟動的 splash 正在提供端口 %lld 的服務 — 應用正使用該伺服器。按「重啟」會將其關閉，並用當前設定由應用運行 splash。";
"port in use" = "端口已被佔用";
"Something else (not splash) is serving port %lld, so the splash the app started exited. Stop that service — or change the port in Settings — then press Start." = "其他程式（非 splash）正在提供端口 %lld 的服務，因此應用啟動的 splash 已退出。停止該服務 — 或在「設定」中變更端口 — 然後按「啟動」。";
"A service other than splash is listening on port %lld — the splash this app started exited because the port was taken. Stop the other service or change the port in Settings." = "除 splash 外的某個服務正在監聽端口 %lld — 本應用啟動的 splash 因端口被佔用而退出。停止其他服務，或在「設定」中變更端口。";
"splash %@ available" = "splash %@ 可用";
"Update Splash" = "更新 Splash";
"Confirm and update splash to %@ through Homebrew; afterwards the server can be restarted onto it." = "確認並通過 Homebrew 將 splash 更新到 %@；之後可重啟伺服器以運行新版本。";
"the newest version" = "最新版本";
"Installed: %@. The update runs `brew upgrade %@`." = "已安裝：%@。更新將運行 `brew upgrade %@`。";
"A newer splash release is available. Update Splash runs brew upgrade for the splash formula; the server restarts only if you confirm it afterwards." = "有新版 splash 發佈可用。「更新 Splash」會為 splash 公式運行 brew upgrade；只有你在之後確認時，伺服器才會重啟。";
"Splash Menu Bar %@ available" = "Splash Menu Bar %@ 可用";
"Update App" = "更新應用";
"Confirm and update Splash Menu Bar to %@ through Homebrew; the app relaunches afterwards." = "確認並通過 Homebrew 將 Splash Menu Bar 更新到 %@；之後應用會重新啟動。";
"Installed: %@. The update runs `brew upgrade --cask splashmenubar`." = "已安裝：%@。更新將運行 `brew upgrade --cask splashmenubar`。";
"A newer Splash Menu Bar release is available. Update App runs brew upgrade for the splashmenubar cask; the app relaunches onto it." = "有新版 Splash Menu Bar 發佈可用。「更新應用」會為 splashmenubar cask 運行 brew upgrade；應用會重新啟動並運行新版本。";
"Get started" = "開始使用";
"Dismiss tip" = "關閉提示";
"Hide this tip." = "隱藏此提示。";
"No splash server is running. Open Settings to choose a splash model, then press ▶ Start. To have the server start whenever the app launches, turn on Start 'splash' server on launch." = "沒有 splash 伺服器在運行。打開「設定」選擇一個 splash 模型，然後按 ▶ 啟動。要讓伺服器隨應用啟動，請開啟「啟動時啟動 splash 伺服器」。";
"Open Settings…" = "打開設定…";
"Choose a model and other splash options." = "選擇模型及其他 splash 選項。";
"Engine error" = "引擎錯誤";
"Metal is reporting a failure; requests may fail or hang until splash is restarted.%@" = "Metal 報告了故障；在重啟 splash 之前，請求可能會失敗或掛起。%@";
"Engine recovering" = "引擎恢復中";
"The inference engine crashed and is restarting; requests can't be served until it's back.%@" = "推理引擎已崩潰並正在重啟；在它恢復之前，請求無法得到處理。%@";
"Engine unstable" = "引擎不穩定";
"The inference engine has crashed and restarted since startup;%@ if it keeps happening, restart splash." = "推理引擎自啟動以來已崩潰並重啟；%@若反覆發生，請重啟 splash。";
" Restarted %lld× since startup." = " 啟動以來已重啟 %lld 次。";
"Yellow: splash is starting (downloading or loading the model)." = "黃色：splash 正在啟動（正在下載或加載模型）。";
"Green: splash is running and ready for requests." = "綠色：splash 正在運行，可處理請求。";
"Green: splash is running." = "綠色：splash 正在運行。";
"Red: splash exited unexpectedly (%@). Press Start to run it again." = "紅色：splash 意外退出（%@）。按「啟動」可再次運行它。";
"Gray: splash is stopped. Press Start to run it." = "灰色：splash 已停止。按「啟動」可運行它。";
"Thermal state of this Mac: macOS's system-wide thermal-pressure state, reported to the app through splash.\n%@\nLevels: nominal → fair → serious → critical.\nThe OS sets it from the whole system and changes it slowly, so it can temporarily disagree with the chip temperature shown next to it." = "此 Mac 的熱狀態：macOS 的系統級熱壓力狀態，通過 splash 報告給應用。\n%@\n級別：正常 → 偏熱 → 嚴重 → 危急。\n該狀態由操作系統根據整個系統設定，且變化緩慢，因此可能與旁邊顯示的芯片溫度暫時不一致。";
"Chip temperature: %@ — the hottest CPU/GPU die sensor, read directly by the app (not from splash). The unit follows the Temperature setting; System uses the computer's region." = "芯片溫度：%@ — 最熱的 CPU/GPU 芯片傳感器，由應用直接讀取（不來自 splash）。單位遵循「溫度」設定；「系統」使用電腦所在地區。";
"Nominal: normal temperature, no thermal limits." = "正常：溫度正常，無熱限制。";
"Fair: slightly warm. Fans may spin up and macOS may trim background work; speeds are usually unaffected." = "偏熱：略有發燙。風扇可能加速，macOS 可能削減後臺工作；速度通常不受影響。";
"Serious: hot. macOS is throttling the CPU and GPU, so tok/s and prefill speed will drop." = "嚴重：發燙。macOS 正在對 CPU 和 GPU 降頻，tok/s 和 prefill 速度會下降。";
"Critical: very hot. Heavy throttling until the Mac cools down." = "危急：非常熱。在 Mac 冷卻之前會大幅降頻。";
"Current state: %@." = "當前狀態：%@。";
"tok/s" = "tok/s";
"Decode speed: tokens generated per second right now, or the average since splash started when idle. The ring auto-scales to the speed graph's window: full ring = a round number at or above the highest tok/s it shows (the graph's top gridline), so 180 tok/s reads instead of pinning the ring. Below the value: the average of the samples the speed graph shows (its dotted line). Right-click to pick the ring's color." = "解碼速度：當前每秒生成的 token 數；空閒時為 splash 啟動以來的平均值。圓環自動適配速度圖的窗口：滿環 = 不低於其顯示的最高 tok/s 的整數（即圖表頂部網格線），因此 180 tok/s 可以直接讀出，而不是把圓環頂滿。數值下方：速度圖所顯示樣本的平均值（即其虛線）。右鍵可選擇圓環顏色。";
"prefill" = "prefill";
"While a prompt is prefilling: how much of it is done (the ring fills as it goes) and the estimated time left. Otherwise: prefill speed in tokens per second, from the last prefill or the average since splash started; a full ring = 500 tok/s. Right-click to pick the ring's color." = "提示詞正在 prefill 時：顯示已完成多少（圓環隨之填充）及預計剩餘時間。其他情況：prefill 速度（token/秒），取自最近一次 prefill 或 splash 啟動以來的平均值；滿環 = 500 tok/s。右鍵可選擇圓環顏色。";
"cached" = "已快取";
"KV cache hit rate since the server started: the share of prompt tokens served from the cache instead of being prefilled again (the per-request figure is LAST REQUEST → Input / cached). Right-click to pick the ring's color." = "伺服器啟動以來的 KV 快取命中率：從快取提供而非重新 prefill 的提示詞 token 佔比（按請求統計的數字見：最近請求 → 輸入 / 已快取）。右鍵可選擇圓環顏色。";
"GPU" = "GPU";
"GPU use across the whole Mac: share of time the GPU was busy, as Activity Monitor reports it. Right-click to pick the bar's color." = "整臺 Mac 的 GPU 使用率：GPU 忙碌時間佔比，以 Activity Monitor 的報告為準。右鍵可選擇條形顏色。";
"CPU" = "CPU";
"CPU use across the whole Mac: share of all cores' time spent busy since the last refresh. Right-click to pick the bar's color." = "整臺 Mac 的 CPU 使用率：自上次刷新以來所有核心忙碌時間佔比。右鍵可選擇條形顏色。";
"RAM" = "RAM";
"Memory used across the whole Mac (app memory + wired + compressed, as Activity Monitor counts it): %@ of %@" = "整臺 Mac 已用記憶體（應用記憶體 + 已線定 + 壓縮，以 Activity Monitor 的統計口徑為準）：%@ / %@";
"Memory used across the whole Mac (app memory + wired + compressed, as Activity Monitor counts it)" = "整臺 Mac 已用記憶體（應用記憶體 + 已線定 + 壓縮，以 Activity Monitor 的統計口徑為準）";
"%@. The bar's color follows the server's memory-pressure report — %@" = "%@。條形顏色跟隨伺服器的記憶體壓力報告 — %@";
"green = normal, yellow = warning, red = critical" = "綠色 = 正常，黃色 = 警告，紅色 = 危急";
"%@; the server hasn't reported one yet." = "%@；伺服器尚未報告過。";
"normal — the Mac has memory to spare" = "正常 — Mac 的記憶體有餘量";
"warning — the system is under memory load; splash's requests may be slower or suspended" = "警告 — 系統記憶體負載較高；splash 的請求可能變慢或被掛起";
"critical — macOS is reclaiming memory aggressively; splash may refuse or drop requests until it eases off" = "危急 — macOS 正在積極回收記憶體；splash 可能拒絕或丟棄請求，直到壓力緩解";
"%@; right now: %@" = "%@；當前：%@";
"Output (last)" = "輸出（最近）";
"Tokens the last request generated." = "最近一個請求生成的 token 數。";
"Input / cached" = "輸入 / 已快取";
"Prompt tokens of the last request / how many of them were reused from the prompt cache instead of being prefilled again. Of the uncached rest, a further share could still read KV that other requests had already computed — the niche \"deduplicated\" figure, no longer shown as its own row." = "最近一個請求的提示詞 token 數 / 其中多少從提示詞快取複用而非重新 prefill。在未被快取的其餘部分中，還有一部分本可以直接讀取其他請求已計算好的 KV — 即小眾的「去重」數字，不再單獨成行顯示。";
"TTFT (last)" = "TTFT（最近）";
"Time to first token of the last request: from arrival until its first output token (mostly prefill)." = "最近一個請求的首 token 時間：從到達直到其第一個輸出 token（主要是 prefill）。";
"Tok/cycle" = "Tok/週期";
"Tokens produced per decode cycle with the draft model: 1 + accepted draft tokens per cycle. Higher means speculative decoding is paying off." = "使用草稿模型時每個 decode 週期產生的 token 數：1 + 每週期被接受的草稿 token 數。數值越高，說明推測解碼越劃算。";
"Requests" = "請求";
"Requests completed since splash started, plus any cancelled or failed." = "splash 啟動以來已完成的請求，另加已取消或失敗的。";
"Prefill" = "Prefill";
"Progress of the prompt being processed now: % done · tokens remaining · estimated time left at the current prefill speed." = "正在處理的提示詞的進度：已完成 % · 剩餘 token 數 · 按當前 prefill 速度估算的剩餘時間。";
" · %@ left" = " · 剩餘 %@";
" · ~%@ left" = " · 約剩 %@";
"Decode" = "Decode";
"Progress of a request generating now: tokens produced · time spent generating · estimated time left when the request has a max-tokens cap (at the current decode speed)." = "正在生成的請求的進度：已生成 token 數 · 生成耗時 · 當請求設有最大 token 上限時，按當前 decode 速度估算的剩餘時間。";
"TTFT (p50 / p95)" = "TTFT（p50 / p95）";
"Time to first token across requests: median / 95th percentile." = "各請求的首 token 時間：中位數 / 第 95 百分位。";
"ITL (p50 / p95)" = "ITL（p50 / p95）";
"Inter-token latency: the time between consecutive output tokens while generating, across requests (median / 95th percentile). For one stream at a time this is the perceived speed — 1000 ÷ ITL tokens per second — so lower is better." = "token 間延遲：生成時連續兩個輸出 token 之間的時間，跨請求統計（中位數 / 第 95 百分位）。一次只有一個流時，這就是感知速度 — 每秒 1000 ÷ ITL 個 token — 因此越低越好。";
"Prefill / decode" = "Prefill / Decode";
"Average speeds since splash started: prompt processing (prefill) / generation (decode)." = "splash 啟動以來的平均速度：提示詞處理（prefill）/ 生成（decode）。";
"Draft accept" = "草稿接受率";
"Speculative decoding (a draft model proposing tokens ahead) is not in use: the server reports no drafted tokens, so the main model generates every token alone." = "未使用推測解碼（由草稿模型預先提議 token）：伺服器報告沒有草稿 token，因此主模型獨自生成每個 token。";
"Speculative decoding: the share of the draft model's proposed tokens the main model accepted (%@ drafted since startup). Higher means the draft pays off; below ~40% it barely helps. LAST REQUEST's Tok/cycle is the same idea per request." = "推測解碼：主模型接受的草稿模型所提議 token 的佔比（啟動以來共產出 %@ 個草稿 token）。佔比越高，說明草稿模型越劃算；低於約 40% 則幾乎幫不上忙。最近請求的 Tok/週期就是按請求看的同一指標。";
"Total output" = "總輸出";
"Tokens generated across all requests since splash started." = "splash 啟動以來所有請求生成的 token 總數。";
"Active" = "進行中";
"Requests in flight right now: generating (decode) · processing their prompt (prefill) · waiting their turn (queued), plus how long the longest-waiting request has waited." = "當前處理中的請求：正在生成（decode）· 正在處理提示詞（prefill）· 排隊等待（queued），以及等待最久的請求已等待多久。";
"splash (server)" = "splash（伺服器）";
"Memory the splash server itself currently holds, as it reports it (— when it doesn't), plus its peak since the server started. Different from the RAM bar in the gauges, which is the whole Mac's memory use." = "splash 伺服器自身當前佔用的記憶體（按其自報；未報告時顯示 —），以及伺服器啟動以來的峰值。與儀表中的 RAM 條形不同，後者是整臺 Mac 的記憶體使用。";
"KV cache" = "KV 快取";
"KV cache: server memory held for prompt context, and how many prompt tokens were served from it since startup instead of being prefilled again — high reuse is why similar prompts run fast." = "KV 快取：伺服器為提示詞上下文保留的記憶體，以及啟動以來有多少提示詞 token 直接取自其中而非重新 prefill — 複用率高就是相似提示詞運行快的原因。";
"Uptime" = "運行時間";
"Time since the server started." = "伺服器啟動以來的時間。";
"%@ done" = "已完成 %@";
" · %@ cancelled" = " · 已取消 %@";
" · %@ failed" = " · 失敗 %@";
"idle" = "空閒";
"%lld decode · %lld prefill · %lld queued" = "%lld decode · %lld prefill · %lld 排隊";
" · waiting %@" = " · 已等待 %@";
"%@ · peak %@" = "%@ · 峰值 %@";
"off" = "關閉";
" · reloading" = " · 重新加載中";
" · released" = " · 已釋放";
" · %lld restored" = " · 已恢復 %lld";
" · %lld failed" = " · %lld 失敗";
"How long loading the model weights took at startup, plus their lifecycle. splash releases the weights from memory after %lld s of idleness to give the RAM back, so the next request restores them (\"reloading\") and is slower." = "啟動時加載模型權重的耗時，及其生命週期。splash 在空閒 %lld 秒後會將權重從記憶體中釋放以歸還 RAM，因此下一個請求會將其恢復（「重新加載中」），速度會變慢。";
"How long loading the model weights took at startup, plus their lifecycle. splash can release the weights from memory after idleness to give the RAM back, so the next request restores them (\"reloading\") and is slower." = "啟動時加載模型權重的耗時，及其生命週期。splash 可以在空閒後將權重從記憶體中釋放以歸還 RAM，因此下一個請求會將其恢復（「重新加載中」），速度會變慢。";
" · writes gated" = " · 寫入受限";
"Persistent cache on disk (Settings: --max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache): used / limit." = "磁碟上的持久快取（設定：--max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache）：已用 / 上限。";
"Persistent cache on disk (Settings: --max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache): used / limit. \"writes gated\" means splash is pausing cache writes (budget or disk full), so new context may not be cached." = "磁碟上的持久快取（設定：--max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache）：已用 / 上限。「寫入受限」表示 splash 正在暫停快取寫入（預算用盡或磁碟已滿），因此新上下文可能不會被快取。";
"age %@ · tick %@" = "快照時長 %@ · 循環耗時 %@";
"Model" = "模型";
"Open in Finder" = "在 Finder 中開啟";
"Open the folder in the Hugging Face cache where the model's files are stored." = "開啟 Hugging Face 快取中存放該模型檔案的資料夾。";
"Type any OWNER/REPO[:VARIANT] model in Settings." = "在設定中鍵入任意 OWNER/REPO[:VARIANT] 模型。";
"Switch the splash model to %@?" = "將 splash 模型切換為 %@？";
"The server restarts with it; requests in progress are cancelled." = "伺服器將使用新模型重啟；進行中的請求會被取消。";
"Switch" = "切換";
"The model splash is serving (Hugging Face repo:variant); context window %@ tokens (prompt + output for one request). Click to switch model — the server restarts with it — or open the model's folder in Finder; Custom… opens Settings." = "splash 正在服務的模型（Hugging Face 儲存庫:變體）；上下文視窗 %@ 個 token（一次請求的輸入 + 輸出）。點擊可切換模型（伺服器將使用新模型重啟）或在 Finder 中開啟模型資料夾；自定義…開啟設定。";
"Endpoint" = "端點";
"Base URL of the OpenAI-compatible API (add /v1). Click to open it in your browser — splash's chat page lives at this address." = "OpenAI 兼容 API 的基礎 URL（加 /v1）。點擊可在瀏覽器中打開 — splash 的聊天頁面就在這個地址。";
"Stop" = "停止";
"Stop the splash server on this port, including one started outside the app." = "停止該端口的 splash 伺服器，包括應用外啟動的。";
"Restart" = "重啟";
"Stop splash and start it again with the current settings." = "停止 splash，並用當前設定再次啟動它。";
"Start" = "啟動";
"Start splash serve with the current settings." = "用當前設定啟動 splash serve。";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Quit Splash Menu Bar. A server the app started is stopped; one started elsewhere keeps running." = "退出 Splash Menu Bar。應用啟動的伺服器會被停止；在別處啟動的伺服器繼續運行。";
"Input" = "輸入";
"Input types this server accepts in prompts." = "該伺服器在提示詞中接受的輸入類型。";
"ANE" = "ANE";
"How the model's FFN (feed-forward) layers are split between the Apple Neural Engine (ANE) and the GPU: the percentage is the ANE's share of the work. ane = all on the ANE, split = shared, gpu = none (e.g. --disable-ane)." = "模型 FFN（前饋）層在 Apple Neural Engine（ANE）與 GPU 之間如何分配：百分比是 ANE 承擔的工作份額。ane = 全部在 ANE 上，split = 共享，gpu = 不使用（例如 --disable-ane）。";
"SSD cache" = "SSD 快取";
"Health" = "健康狀況";
"splash's self-report: how old its own status snapshot is (it refreshes every event-loop tick, so normally ~0), and the longest loop tick since startup. A stale snapshot or a long tick means the server's loop is slow or blocked and requests stall." = "splash 的自報資料：其自身狀態快照的新鮮程度（它在每次事件循環 tick 時刷新，因此通常約為 0），以及啟動以來最長的循環 tick。快照陳舊或 tick 過長，說明伺服器循環變慢或被阻塞，請求會停滯。";
"Weights" = "權重";
"avg %@" = "平均 %@";
"no decode samples yet" = "尚無 decode 樣本";
"Color…" = "顏色…";
"AI harness" = "AI 框架";
"Server" = "伺服器";
"App" = "應用";
"About" = "關於";
"Reset to defaults" = "恢復預設值";
"Set every option to its default. Nothing is saved or restarted until you press Save." = "將所有選項設為預設值。在你按「儲存」之前，不會儲存或重啟任何內容。";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Close without saving." = "關閉且不儲存。";
"Save" = "儲存";
"Save these options to ~/.splashmenubar.json and restart splash with them." = "將這些選項儲存到 ~/.splashmenubar.json，並用它們重啟 splash。";
"--model: a supported model, or Custom… for any Hugging Face model as OWNER/REPO[:VARIANT] with the GGUF variant after ':'. Downloaded models are found in the Hugging Face cache; others download on first start, along with their draft." = "--model：受支援的模型，或用 Custom… 填寫任意 Hugging Face 模型，格式為 OWNER/REPO[:VARIANT]，GGUF 變體寫在 '：' 之後。已下載的模型可在 Hugging Face 快取中找到；其他模型會在首次啟動時下載，連同其草稿模型一起。";
"OWNER/REPO[:VARIANT]" = "OWNER/REPO[:VARIANT]";
"Model %@" = "模型 %@";
"Needs about %lld GB of RAM — this Mac has %lld GB, so this model will likely not run here" = "大約需要 %lld GB RAM — 這臺 Mac 有 %lld GB，因此該模型很可能無法在此運行";
"Downloaded" = "已下載";
"Not downloaded" = "未下載";
"%@ — %@" = "%@ — %@";
"%@ · %lld GB" = "%@ · %lld GB";
"Custom…" = "自定義…";
"Downloaded · %@ on disk" = "已下載 · 磁碟佔 %@";
"Open in Finder the folder where this model is stored (the Hugging Face cache)." = "在 Finder 中打開存放該模型的資料夾（Hugging Face 快取）。";
"Not downloaded · the first start downloads it" = "未下載 · 首次啟動時會下載";
"Checking the model cache…" = "正在檢查模型快取…";
"Manage…" = "管理…";
"The Hugging Face cache (~/.cache/huggingface/hub) where splash keeps downloaded models, including the separate versions of a repo it has fetched. Manage lists them, downloads new models, and removes what's no longer wanted." = "splash 存放已下載模型的 Hugging Face 快取（~/.cache/huggingface/hub），包括其已拉取的 repo 的各個獨立版本。「管理」可列出它們、下載新模型，並刪除不再需要的內容。";
"Pin model version" = "固定模型版本";
"--revision: pin splash to the commit of the model already in the Hugging Face cache, so a new commit on the repository's default branch is not re-downloaded over the copy on disk. Off by default, when splash follows the default branch. With no complete copy in the cache there is no version to pin, so the first start downloads as usual and only restarts after are pinned." = "--revision：將 splash 固定到 Hugging Face 快取中已有模型的 commit，這樣倉庫預設分支上的新 commit 就不會重新下載並覆蓋磁碟上的副本。預設關閉，此時 splash 跟隨預設分支。若快取中沒有完整副本，就沒有可固定的版本，因此首次啟動照常下載，只有之後的重啟才會被固定。";
"Point a coding harness at the splash server. Auto Connect writes the harness's own configuration, so it uses splash from a terminal too; start it in a new session after connecting. Every supported harness is listed; the uninstalled ones can be connected once their binary is on the PATH." = "讓編碼框架指向 splash 伺服器。自動連線會寫入框架自身的配置，因此它在終端中也會使用 splash；連線後請在新工作階段中啟動它。所有受支援的框架都會列出；未安裝的框架，一旦其二進制檔案在 PATH 上即可連線。";
"%@ (not installed)" = "%@（未安裝）";
"Connecting…" = "正在連線…";
"Auto Connect" = "自動連線";
"Install it to connect it — Auto Connect writes the harness's own configuration." = "安裝它即可連線 — 自動連線會寫入框架自身的配置。";
"Port" = "端口";
"8000" = "8000";
"--port: HTTP port the server listens on (127.0.0.1)." = "--port：伺服器監聽的 HTTP 端口（127.0.0.1）。";
"Port %@" = "端口 %@";
"Max memory" = "最大記憶體";
"auto (e.g. 28G)" = "自動（例如 28G）";
"--max-memory: Metal memory budget, e.g. 28G. It can only lower the automatic budget. Blank = auto." = "--max-memory：Metal 記憶體預算，例如 28G。它只能調低自動預算。留空 = 自動。";
"Idle release" = "空閒釋放";
"10m default (e.g. off)" = "預設 10m（例如 off）";
"--idle-release: time without a request before splash frees the model weights and memory, e.g. 30m, 1h; off keeps them loaded. Blank = 10m." = "--idle-release：splash 釋放模型權重和記憶體前的無請求時長，例如 30m、1h；off 表示保持加載。留空 = 10m。";
"Max context" = "最大上下文";
"auto (e.g. 100K)" = "自動（例如 100K）";
"--max-context: context token limit, e.g. 100K or 1M. Past the model's native window (256K) it turns on YaRN, which changes answers, so go higher only when needed. Blank = auto." = "--max-context：上下文 token 上限，例如 100K 或 1M。超過模型原生窗口（256K）時會啟用 YaRN，這會使答案發生變化，因此只在需要時調高。留空 = 自動。";
"KV format" = "KV 格式";
"int8 (default)" = "int8（預設）";
"bf16" = "bf16";
"--kv-format: storage for the KV cache. int8 (default) uses less memory; bf16 uses more." = "--kv-format：KV 快取的存儲格式。int8（預設）佔用記憶體更少；bf16 佔用更多。";
"State format" = "狀態格式";
"fp32 (default)" = "fp32（預設）";
"--state-format: storage for recurrent state. fp32 (default); bf16 halves each state, so memory and the SSD cache hold about twice as many." = "--state-format：循環狀態的存儲格式。fp32（預設）；bf16 將每個狀態減半，因此記憶體和 SSD 快取大約可多容納一倍。";
"Max cache disk" = "最大快取磁碟";
"auto (e.g. 16G; 0 = off)" = "自動（例如 16G；0 = 關閉）";
"--max-cache-disk: SSD quota for cached KV pages and states, e.g. 16G; 0 disables the SSD cache. Blank = auto (a quarter of free space, at most 32G)." = "--max-cache-disk：快取的 KV 頁和狀態的 SSD 配額，例如 16G；0 表示停用 SSD 快取。留空 = 自動（可用空間的四分之一，最多 32G）。";
"Language only" = "僅語言";
"--language-only: skip loading vision; image and PDF input is refused. Saves memory and startup time." = "--language-only：跳過加載視覺模組；拒絕圖像和 PDF 輸入。可節省記憶體和啟動時間。";
"Disable Neural Engine" = "停用神經引擎";
"--disable-ane: prefill on the GPU alone. By default long prompts on dense models also use the Neural Engine when that's faster." = "--disable-ane：僅用 GPU 做 prefill。預設情況下，稠密模型的長提示詞在神經引擎更快的情況下也會使用神經引擎。";
"Persistent cache" = "持久快取";
"--persistent-cache: keep the SSD prompt cache across restarts, so earlier conversations resume without re-prefilling." = "--persistent-cache：在重啟之間保留 SSD 提示詞快取，這樣之前的對話可以恢復，無需重新 prefill。";
"splash serve — parameters" = "splash serve — 參數";
"Changing a splash option restarts the server." = "變更 splash 選項會重啟伺服器。";
"UI refresh" = "UI 刷新";
"%lld ms" = "%lld ms";
"%lld s (default)" = "%lld s（預設）";
"%lld s" = "%lld s";
"How often the app polls splash's /status endpoint to update the flyout and the menu bar. Faster is more responsive and costs a little more CPU. Changing only this does not restart the server." = "應用輪詢 splash 的 /status 端點以更新彈出面板和菜單欄的頻率。更快會更靈敏，但稍費 CPU。只變更此項不會重啟伺服器。";
"Speed graph span" = "速度圖跨度";
"%lld min (default)" = "%lld min（預設）";
"%lld min" = "%lld min";
"How many minutes of generation the tok/s graph shows. Only time spent generating is sampled, so idle gaps don't count. Changing only this does not restart the server." = "tok/s 圖表顯示多少分鐘的生成過程。只對生成中花費的時間採樣，因此空閒間隔不計入。只變更此項不會重啟伺服器。";
"Auto-restart" = "自動重啟";
"If splash exits on its own, start it again after a moment — up to %lld times in a row before giving up. Pressing Start resets the count; a Stop always wins over it. A crash also gets a notification unless it is being auto-restarted." = "如果 splash 自行退出，稍等片刻後再次啟動 — 連續最多 %lld 次，之後放棄。按「啟動」會重置計數；「停止」始終優先於它。崩潰時也會收到通知，除非正在自動重啟。";
"Start 'splash' server on launch" = "啟動時啟動 splash 伺服器";
"Start the splash server with the model above whenever Splash Menu Bar launches. Off by default: the app opens with the server stopped (a splash already running on the port is still picked up), and you press Start. Changing it does not restart the server." = "每次 Splash Menu Bar 啟動時，用上方的模型啟動 splash 伺服器。預設關閉：應用打開時伺服器處於停止狀態（端口上已在運行的 splash 仍會被接管），由你按「啟動」。變更此項不會重啟伺服器。";
"Launch at login" = "登入時啟動";
"Start Splash Menu Bar when you log in — with Start 'splash' server on launch also on, the splash server comes up without opening the app. Registered as a system login item (System Settings → General → Login Items); changing it does not restart the server." = "登入時啟動 Splash Menu Bar — 同時開啟「啟動時啟動 splash 伺服器」時，splash 伺服器會在不打開應用的情況下啟動。註冊為系統登入項（System Settings → 通用 → 登入項）；變更此項不會重啟伺服器。";
"Appearance" = "外觀";
"The flyout's (and this window's) color theme: follow the system's dark/light mode, or force one. The preview here updates as you pick; the flyout takes it on Save. Changing only this does not restart the server." = "彈出面板（和本窗口）的配色主題：跟隨系統的深色/淺色模式，或強制使用某一種。這裡的預覽會隨你的選擇更新；彈出面板在「儲存」時應用。只變更此項不會重啟伺服器。";
"Temperature" = "溫度";
"The unit the chip temperature shows in. System (the default) follows the computer's region — System Settings → General → Language & Region; pick Fahrenheit or Celsius to override it. Changing only this does not restart the server." = "芯片溫度顯示所用的單位。「系統」（預設）跟隨電腦所在地區 — System Settings → 通用 → 語言與地區；選擇華氏度或攝氏可覆蓋它。只變更此項不會重啟伺服器。";
