"Splash Menu Bar — Update splash" = "Splash Menu Bar — 更新 splash";
"Restart the splash server?" = "要重啟 splash 伺服器嗎？";
"splash was updated, but the running server still uses the old version until it restarts. Requests in progress are cancelled." = "splash 已更新，但正在運行的伺服器在重啟前仍使用舊版本。進行中的請求將被取消。";
"The update needs Homebrew to run:\n    %@" = "更新需要 Homebrew 來運行：\n    %@";
"Not installed through Homebrew" = "不是通過 Homebrew 安裝的";
"This copy of Splash Menu Bar isn't a Homebrew install, so brew can't update it.\nInstall it once with:\n    %@\nor download the new release from GitHub." = "這個版本的 Splash Menu Bar 不是 Homebrew 安裝的，因此 brew 無法更新它。\n請安裝一次：\n    %@\n或從 GitHub 下載新版本。";
"Update Splash Menu Bar to %@?" = "要將 Splash Menu Bar 更新到 %@ 嗎？";
"You have %@. This runs:\n%@\nA progress window shows what Homebrew is doing; the app relaunches afterwards." = "你當前安裝的是 %@。將運行：\n%@\n進度窗口會顯示 Homebrew 正在做什麼；之後應用會重新啟動。";
"Splash Menu Bar — Update app" = "Splash Menu Bar — 更新應用";
"Restart Splash Menu Bar?" = "要重啟 Splash Menu Bar 嗎？";
"The new version starts now; anything in progress in this one is lost." = "新版本現在啟動；此版本中正在進行的內容將丟失。";
"Couldn't relaunch Splash Menu Bar" = "無法重新啟動 Splash Menu Bar";
"Couldn't enable launch at login" = "無法啟用登入時啟動";
"Couldn't turn off launch at login" = "無法關閉登入時啟動";
"Couldn't save settings" = "無法儲存設定";
"The changes apply for this session, but the config file couldn't be written: %@. They'll be lost when the app quits." = "變更僅在本次工作階段中生效，但設定檔無法寫入：%@。退出應用時這些變更將丟失。";
"Splash Menu Bar — Manage models" = "Splash Menu Bar — 管理模型";
"Update" = "更新";
"Language" = "語言";
"System (%@)" = "系統（%@）";
"Relaunch Now" = "立即重新啟動";
"Later" = "稍後";
"Relaunch to apply the language?" = "重新啟動以套用語言？";
"The new language takes effect when Splash Menu Bar relaunches. The splash server keeps running." = "新語言將在 Splash Menu Bar 重新啟動後生效。splash 伺服器將繼續運行。";
"The app's UI language. System (the default) follows the computer's language — System Settings → General → Language & Region — and falls back to English when the system language isn't supported. Saving a different language relaunches the app to apply it; the splash server keeps running." = "應用介面語言。系統（預設）跟隨電腦的語言 — 系統設定 → 通用 → 語言與地區 — 系統語言不受支援時回退到英語。儲存其他語言後會重新啟動應用以套用；splash 伺服器繼續運行。";
